{"t": 1794110377.2923284, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_transition_issue", "args": {"comment": "Implemented `payments.masking.mask_iban` in `payments/masking.py`.\n\nBehaviour (per acceptance criteria):\n- spaces removed before masking\n- first 2 characters (country code) and last 4 characters kept\n- every other character replaced with `*`, so output length equals the space-free input length\n\nExample: `DE89 3704 0044 0532 0130 00` -> `DE****************3000`\n\nAdded tests in `tests/test_masking.py` (8 passing, `python -m pytest -q`).\nNote: the GitHub repo `acme/payments` returned no branches/files from the API, so no PR could be opened against it; the change currently lives in the working tree.", "issue_key": "PAY-412", "transition_id": "31"}, "ok": true}
